:: Bailey Offer Yourself
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>
<<if $stockholm_points is undefined>><<set $stockholm_points to {}>><</if>>
<<set $bailey_offered to ($bailey_offered || 0)>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"I-I have the money," you say quietly. You hold it out, then pull it back slightly. "But I could... go. If you wanted. I-I'll be back."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You show Bailey the money without handing it over. "I can pay, but perhaps my cooperation would be worth more. I will return when it's over."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You hold the money against your chest. "You can send me instead, if that's what you want. I'll come back."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I brought the money, but you have another option," you say. "Send me. I'll return on my own."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"I have your money," you say, holding the money out. "But you can send me. I'll just be right back, anyway."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You snap the money between your fingers. "Keep this or sell my time. Choose whichever earns you more."
<<else>>
	"I have the money," you say, holding the money out. "But I'll go willingly, if that's worth more to you."
<</if>>
<br><br>

/* Always guard with `<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>` before `<<set $money -= ...>>`. */

<<if $bailey_offered is undefined or $bailey_offered is 0>>
	<<if $baileydefeated gte 5>>
		Bailey goes very still. <<He>> frowns deeply, <<his>> eyes moving over your face.
		<br><br>

		"Finally," <<he>> sneers. "All that fighting. All that fuss." <<He>> takes the money from you.<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>><<money `-($rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0))` "baileyRent">><</if>> "What a waste of time. At least you're finally doing what you're told."
		<br><br>

		<<He>> produces a hood and rope from behind <<his>> back.
		<br><br>

		"Fine, you little shit. Let's see how you do."<<npcincr Bailey dom 3>><<gggdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">><<set $syndromebaileybuild += 3>><<set $stockholm_points.offer to true>><<set $stockholm_points.offer_defeat to true>><<gbaileystock>>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		Bailey goes very still. <<His>> eyes move over your face, evaluating it for something. The corner of <<his>> mouth twitches into a smirk.
		<br><br>

		<<He>> takes the money from you.<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>><<money `-($rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0))` "baileyRent">><</if>> Then <<he>> produces a hood and rope from behind <<his>> back.
		<br><br>

		"Don't make me regret this."<<npcincr Bailey dom 3>><<gggdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">><<set $syndromebaileybuild += 1>><<set $stockholm_points.offer to true>><<gbaileystock>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	/* Don't bump $bailey_offered here. That happens later in Bailey Offer Walk. */
<<else>> /* Stockholm Activation */
	<<if $syndromebaileybuild gte 3 and $syndromebailey isnot true>> 
		<<set $bailey_offered += 1>>
		<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>
			<<money `-($rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0))` "baileyRent">>
		<</if>>
		<<set $baileydefeatedchain to 0>>
		<<set $baileyRefusedToPay to 0>>
		<<set $baileyRefusedToPayTotal to $baileyRefusedToPayTotal lt $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0) ? 0 : $baileyRefusedToPayTotal - ($rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0))>>
		<<unset $bailey_encroach>>

		<<He>> takes the money from your hand and counts it slower than usual. <<He>> folds it into <<his>> coat.
		<br><br>

		<<He>> doesn't produce a hood and rope this time. <<His>> hand closes around your arm. <<He>> steers you down the hallway, past the other doors, past the kitchen, into <<his>> office.
		<br><br>

		<<He>> shuts and locks the door behind <<him>>.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Bailey Stockholm Reveal]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $money gte $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0)>>
			<<money `-($rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0))` "baileyRent">>
		<</if>>
		<<if $bailey_offered gte 4>>
			Bailey tosses you a hood. <<He>>'s smiling at you.
			<br><br>

			"You know the way."
		<<elseif $bailey_offered gte 3>>
			The hood is already in <<his>> hand. <<He>> holds it out to you.
			<br><br>

			You take it. The last thing you see before you put the hood on is Bailey's smirk.
		<<else>>
			Bailey lets out a light exhale. <<He>> pulls out a hood and ropes from seemingly nowhere.
			<br><br>

			"Let's go, then."<<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

		<<set $bailey_offered += 1>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<if $syndromebaileybuild lt 3 or $syndromebailey is true or $bailey_offered lte 1>>
	<<set $baileydefeatedchain to 0>>
	<<set $baileyRefusedToPay to 0>>
	<<set $baileyRefusedToPayTotal to $baileyRefusedToPayTotal lt $rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0) ? 0 : $baileyRefusedToPayTotal - ($rentmoney + ($babyRent || 0))>>
	<<unset $bailey_encroach>>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen and $bailey_offered_seen.manor and $bailey_offered_seen.eden and $bailey_offered_seen.remy and $bailey_offered_seen.underground and setup.inflation.canAfford(300000, "baileyRent")>>
		<<link [[Ask to choose where you're sent (<<printmoney 300000>>)|Bailey Choose Buyer Ask]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Offer Walk
<<effects>>
<<set $soldCount += 1>>
<<set $bailey_offered_seen to ($bailey_offered_seen || {})>>
<<person1>>
<<set $phase to 0>> /* Force phase to 0 so Robin isn't sold alongside PC. */
<<if $bailey_offered gte 3>>
	You pull the hood over your own head. Bailey binds your arms behind your back, loosely. You know the route by now. Down the stairs, along the tunnel. Bailey walks beside you.
<<elseif $bailey_offered gte 2>>
	With the hood over your head and your arms bound behind your back, you are led down the stairs and along the tunnel. Bailey's hand rests on your shoulder, guiding you down the tunnel.
<<else>>
	With your head covered by a hood and your arms bound behind your back, you are led down a flight of stairs and along a tunnel. Bailey's grip on your arm is firm but steady. You manage not to trip despite the brutal pace Bailey set.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<pass 20>>

<<if $rentsale is 3>>
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen.underground>>
		Bailey walks you down the corridor.
		<br><br>
		"Underground brothel," <<he>> says, like <<he>>'s reading from a list. "You'll be there a while. Keep your head down and find a way out."
	<<else>>
		Bailey leads you down the corridor. <<His>> pace is slower than usual.
		<br><br>
		"The underground brothel," <<he>> spits out. "Escape when you can. <span class="bailey-red">Come back to me.</span>"
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

<<elseif $rentsale is 2>>
	<<if $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar" and $worn.neck.cursed is 1 and ($avery_fate is "saved" or $avery_fate is "fallen" or $avery_fate is "kicked")>>
		Bailey stops walking. You feel <<his>> hand tracing along your collar.
		<br><br>
		"Change of plans," <<he>> says. "Someone paid more." <<He>> pauses. "Be careful with the shopkeep. You don't know what you're getting yourself into, brat."
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $bailey_offered_seen.remy>>
		"Remy's farm," <<he>> says while <<he>> walks you. "You've been there. You know what they do."
	<<else>>
		Bailey is quiet for a long time. You can tell <<he>>'s angry, even though you can't see <<him>>.
		<br><br>
		"You'll be taken to a farm," <<he>> says. "Try to stay in one piece."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

<<elseif $rentsale is 1>>
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen.eden>>
		"Eden," Bailey says to you. "Enjoy your time playing house. I'll see you when you come home."
	<<else>>
		"Someone in the forest wants company," Bailey says to you. You can hear something stiff in <<his>> tone. "You'll manage."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

<<else>>
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen.manor>>
		"Watch the dogs," <<he>> says. "I'll see you when you're home."
	<<else>>
		"Dinner party," <<he>> says. "You're on the menu."
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $rentsale is 3>>
	<<set $rentsale to 0>><<generate2>><<person2>>
	After journeying for some time you hear another set of footsteps. "Hand <<phim stranger>> over," says a <<personssimple>> voice.
	<br><br>

	"Money first," responds Bailey. "Will I get <<phim "Bailey">> back?"
	<br><br>

	"You won't want <<phim stranger>> when we're done."
	<<if $bailey_offered_seen.underground>>
		<br><br>
		Bailey exhales once through <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> nose. <span class="bailey-red">"I wouldn't bet on that."</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	You hear a rustle of paper before being dragged further along the tunnel.
	<br><br>

	<<badEndTracking "Underground Dungeon" { reason: "soldBailey" }>>
	<<link [[Next|Underground Intro]]>><<set $baileySold to true>><<set $bailey_offered_seen.underground to true>><<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>><</link>>
	<br>

<<elseif $rentsale is 2>>
	<<set $rentsale += 1>>
	<<if $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar" and $worn.neck.cursed is 1 and ($avery_fate is "saved" or $avery_fate is "fallen" or $avery_fate is "kicked")>>
		You journey until you hear wind rustling through leaves.<br><br>
		"The witch made arrangements," Bailey starts as <<he>> lifts you and hooks your bindings on something behind you, leaving you suspended in the air.
		<br><br>
		You feel <<his>> hands run along your collar. "Lucky you."
		<br><br>
		You hear <<him>> walk away, leaving you alone.
		<br><br>

		<<set $bailey_offered_seen.remy to true>>
		<<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>>
		<<endevent>>
		<<rentGwylanTrade>>
	<<else>>
		<<leash 21>>
		You journey until you hear the sound of engines up ahead. The sound echoes, becoming closer, until you hear it all around you.
		"Good stock," says an unfamiliar voice. "Would make a fine breeder."
		<br><br>
		"The money," Bailey responds, impatient.
		<br><br>
		"Ah. Here." There's a rustle to one side, then someone tugs on your leash, pulling you forward.
		<br><br>
		"A pleasure," Bailey says, already walking away.
		<br><br>

		"Watch the step," says the unfamiliar voice. Whatever you've stepped onto is rumbling. "Sit."
		You fumble around your knees, and find what feels like a bench.
		You sit, then hear the slam of doors, and a few moments later you lurch as the floor moves beneath you. You're in a vehicle.
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Street Van Bailey]]>><<set $baileySold to true>><<set $bailey_offered_seen.remy to true>><<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

<<elseif $rentsale is 1>>
	<<set $rentsale += 1>>
	<<person1>>
	You journey for some time until you hear birdsong, and the crunch of earth beneath your feet. A door creaks. Bailey pushes you forward, and you hear the door close and lock behind you.
	<br><br>

	<<set $bailey_offered_seen.eden to true>>
	<<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<rentEdenTrade>>

<<else>>
	<<set $rentsale to 1>>
	<<generate2>><<person2>>
	After journeying for some time you hear another set of footsteps. "This is the merchandise?" says a <<personssimple>> voice.
	<br><br>

	"No, I'm just taking my <<girl>> for a walk," says Bailey, <<person1>><<nnpc_his "Bailey">> temper barely concealed beneath the sarcasm. "Just give me the cash."
	<br><br>

	A moment later, you feel someone press something against your mouth, and your consciousness fades.<<arousal 6000>><<gggarousal>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Danube Meal]]>><<endevent>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $bailey_offered_seen.manor to true>><<if $bailey_offered is 0 or $bailey_offered is undefined>><<set $bailey_offered to 1>><</if>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bailey Choose Buyer Ask
<<effects>><<speechresolve>><<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Uhm... May I choose where I am sent?" you ask, looking down at the floor. "I'll pay."
<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	"Could I select the arrangement myself?" you ask. "I am prepared to pay for the choice."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You touch the edge of the hood. "May I choose where you send me, if I pay?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	"I'll pay to choose the buyer," you say. "Tell me the price."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Let me choose where I get sent," you say, looking right at <<him>>. "I got the cash."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You push the hood aside. "I'm choosing who gets me. You can take my money and stay out of it."
<<else>>
	"Can I choose where I get sent?" you ask, looking at the hood and ropes. "I can pay."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey regards you for a moment and shrugs.
<br><br>

<<if C.npc.Bailey.dom lt 30>>
	"You go where I sell you," Bailey says with a sneer. "You volunteered for this, brat. Let's go."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	"Fine," <<he>> says. "Pay up. <<printprice 300000>>."
	<br><br>

	<<if setup.inflation.canAfford(300000, "baileyRent")>><<money -300000 "baileyRent">><</if>>
	You hand <<him>> the money.
	<br><br>

	"You know your usual buyers," Bailey nods after squaring your money away. "I'll let you choose, since I'm feeling generous."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[The Manor|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><<set $rentsale to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Eden's cabin|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><<set $rentsale to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Remy's farm|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><<set $rentsale to 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[The Underground Brothel|Bailey Offer Walk]]>><<set $rentsale to 3>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Bailey Sell Kick
<<effects>><<endevent>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

You walk for a long time, hooded, your wrists bound behind your back.
<br><br>

Bailey stops walking. You walk right into <<him>>. <<His>> hand closes around your arm to hold you still.
<br><br>

<<Hes>> quiet. You hear <<him>> breathe out through <<his>> nose.
<br><br>

Without warning, <<he>> kicks you in your ribs.<<pain 6>><<gpain>>
<br><br>

You fold around it. The hood twists against your face.
<br><br>

"Worthless," <<he>> says.<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

<<His>> shoe meets your shins. You hit the floor on your shoulder. The rope bites at your wrists. The hood is hot against your face, your own breath trapped inside it.
<br><br>

<<link [[Endure|Bailey Sell Kick Endure]]>><</link>><<willpowerdifficulty 1 600>>
<br>
<<link [[Beg|Bailey Sell Kick Beg]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4) and $masochism gte 300>>
	<<link [[Lick <<his>> shoe|Bailey Sell Kick Lick]]>><</link>><<promiscuous4>><<if !$settings.blindStatsEnabled>> | <span class="purple">Masochism</span><</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Bailey Sell Kick Endure
<<effects>>
<<person1>>

You're on your knees now. You try to endure Bailey's punishment.
<br><br>

A kick lands across your face.
<br><br>

<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	You take it. You don't make a sound.<<gwillpower>><<willpower 3>>
	<br><br>

	The toe of <<his>> boot nudges your shoulder. You stay still. Bailey exhales above you.<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You cry out.</span><<pain 4>><<gpain>><<gwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
	<br><br>

	"Shut up, you little shit," Bailey says. <<He>> kicks you across the face again in the same spot. "Do you have to be so noisy all the time?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> hauls you up by your bindings. Your body aches everywhere <<he>> kicked you.
<br><br>

<<He>> makes you walk forward.
<br><br>

<<link "Next" $bailey_kick_return>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Sell Kick Beg
<<effects>><<speechresolve>>
<<person1>>

<<if (_speechAttitudeResolved is "meek" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "shy")>>
	"Please! S-Stop it!" you beg. "Why are you doing this?"
	<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "polite" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "flamboyant")>>
	You raise one arm to protect yourself. "Bailey, please stop. Tell me what you want."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "docile">>
	You curl around the pain and wait for the next kick. "Please... I'll do what you say."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "confident">>
	You catch Bailey's ankle before <<he>> can kick again. "Stop. Explain what you're doing."
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty">>
	"Stop it, Bailey!" you demand. "What's wrong with you?"
<<elseif _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel">>
	You bare your teeth and shove <<his>> foot away. "Kick me again. See what I break first."
<<else>>
	"Stop!" you hiss out. "Why are you doing this?"
<</if>>
<br><br>

A swift kick lands across your face.<<pain 4>><<gpain>>
<br><br>

"This is the least you deserve, brat." You can imagine the sneer on Bailey's face when <<he>> speaks. "Get up."
<br><br>

<<He>> hauls you up by your bindings. Your body aches everywhere <<he>> kicked you.
<br><br>

<<He>> makes you walk forward.
<br><br>

<<link "Next" $bailey_kick_return>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Sell Kick Lick
<<effects>><<person1>>
<<set $stockholm_points to ($stockholm_points || {})>>

You hear the scuff of Bailey's shoes in front of you.
<br><br>

The floor is cold and damp under your knees. You can't see. You reach blindly with your face across the floor until the hood shifts upwards and your cheek finds <<his>> shoe.
<br><br>

You press your tongue to it. You taste dirt and salt and leather.<<arousal 600>><<garousal>><<masochism 2>><<gmasochism>>
<br><br>

Bailey goes still. Your tongue moves clumsily over the surface of <<his>> shoe.
<br><br>

"Look at you." Bailey scoffs above you. "Pathetic."<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<<He>> lifts <<his>> foot and presses the toe against your jaw, holding you there for a moment. The tunnels are filled with the sound of your breathing.
<br><br>

Eventually, Bailey pulls you up by your bindings. <<He>> walks slower than before.<<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<if !$stockholm_points.kick>><<set $syndromebaileybuild += 1>><<set $stockholm_points.kick to true>><<gbaileystock>><</if>>
<br><br>

You walk the rest of the way with the taste of <<his>> shoe still in your mouth.
<br><br>

<<link "Next" $bailey_kick_return>><</link>>
<br>
